    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Mains-powered family of automatic checkweighing instruments designated the D3. Devices include semi-automatic zero-setting, initial zero-setting, zero-tracking, automatic zero setting during automatic operation (at least every 5 min), pre-set tare device (subtractive), static and dynamic calibration (not user accessible), belt speed setting, internal memory for batch reports, device acting upon significant faults, and screen check at power-up. Interfaces: RS 232 and USB (only for data collection on memory stick)."
